lunduke-city (0.8-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Query describes population, land value, crime, pollution, and growth
    on each field's own scale.
  * Loading a city keeps the saved road, police, and fire funding, and
    the service effects match those percents.
  * The city name, including spaces, is stored in the save and survives
    Save, Save As, Load, and Rename City. Older saves still load.
  * Crime and pollution graphs and the smoothed census ramps survive
    save and load. City time still round-trips.
  * A failed save no longer leaves the live city byte-swapped.
  * Budget "Current funds" matches cash on hand. "Previous funds" is
    the balance before this year's budget.
  * With auto budget off, the budget window can change this year's
    road, police, and fire rates before they are paid.
  * Fires, crashes, the monster, tornadoes, and earthquakes move the
    view to the event when auto-goto is on. Earthquakes shake the map.
  * Zoom keeps the neighborhood in the center of the view.
  * Opening Evaluation mid-year no longer consumes last year's migration
    or the yearly score change.
  * New City and scenarios release deactivated sprites.

 -- LCOS <lcos@lunduke.com>  Sat, 03 Oct 2026 15:40:00 +0000

